- Removed €0 text label from SVG
- Kept only €5k/€10k/€15k grid lines (removed the y=210 x-axis line)
- Added `font-size=12` to all SVG `<text>` elements (month labels and grid line labels)

**Fix 4 - Channel table:**
- Wrapped in `<article class="card card--outlined">` with `card__header` and `<h2>By channel, November</h2>`
- Header cells now have `class=num`
- Totals row has `class=total` with first cell "Total"
