- Removed `.table-wrap` and `.table` CSS rules from `<style>` (now in components.css)
- Added `.table .total td { font: var(--md-title-small); border-bottom: 0; }` to `<style>`

**Fix 5 - Room performance card:**
- Added `<div class=card__header><h2 class=t-title-medium>Room performance</h2></div>`
- Replaced flex layout with `.room-row` grid layout: `display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 200px) minmax(0, 1fr) 120px; gap: var(--sp-4); align-items: center; padding: var(--sp-2) 0`
- Room names use format "Room X · Type" (e.g., "Room 1 · Garden double")
- `.room-row .num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }`
- Room 5 includes muted note "5 days out of order"

